  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of the Federal Institute for Access to Information (IFAI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed grant is geared to strengthen institutional capacities of the Federal Institute for Access to Information (IFAI) and to extend the federal experience to decentralized levels of the Mexican public sector.  It would support: (i) designing a strategy to organize federal agencies. archives in order to make the Access to Information System more accurate, effective, and operational; and (ii) enabling state and municipal governments in Mexico to adopt and adapt the Access to Information System (AIS) jointly developed by the IFAI and the Secretariat of Public Administration (SFP).</narrative>
  </description>
